      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Magicweaving</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use magicweaving, the temporary spell points last until the start of your next turn and may be used for any number of magic sphere effects rather than all being used in a singular spell effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/raveler-class#toc53\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
